        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This set honors the raw power of nature’s bounty. Each sticker is a badge of honor for choosing real food over wrappers. It’s for those who appreciate the beauty in a bundle of kale or the perfect symmetry of an avocado."
